    },
    "intro-2": {
      "file": "assets/vo/intro-2.mp3",
      "voice": "aura-2-draco-en",
      "text": "Beneath his throne, he buried the final bell. It stole the names of the dead, and taught their bodies to rise again.",
      "scriptHash": "808be59d39cc5103bef1e64582a0388bbb9c30d1adf69a3914086da8a253275b",
      "bytes": 47088,
      "sha256": "50deb4f62689af87c497a73f61dc8743623a3a0eaddd90f7f2fa6c32b47ca6bd"
    },
    "intro-3": {
      "file": "assets/vo/intro-3.mp3",
      "voice": "aura-2-draco-en",
      "text": "Now a hundred floors separate the fading world from its stolen dawn. Ten forgotten realms. Ten souls that will not rest.",
      "scriptHash": "b9337190e6b0369079301ea7b05fd3f8a16d0c48b5b3d7b67e1bb3e097a211e2",
      "bytes": 54288,
      "sha256": "041ad49b89b6abe94db664f6cb01e2a28771d59c5f0904759cd20e7d5a2ca842"
    },
    "intro-4": {
      "file": "assets/vo/intro-4.mp3",
      "voice": "aura-2-draco-en",
      "text": "A knight without a king. A hunter without a name. A seer without a future. One of them must carry the last ember below.",
      "scriptHash": "3aedb9cded7248cc6e0eb5ebcfa437386b7ac3020e4a781e50e832ad42735025",
      "bytes": 57024,
      "sha256": "e40c6edb92dac7bb03c08179db45246c1e113315dbf553263d646fe0c7f0d69b"
    },
    "intro-5": {
      "file": "assets/vo/intro-5.mp3",
      "voice": "aura-2-draco-en",
      "text": "Descend, wanderer. Gather what the darkness has forgotten. And when the final bell calls your name, answer with steel.",
